OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a row over moving a Surrey    
OL,4,Aschool is not ending                   
OL,6,FTo all intents and purposes, the       
OL,7,Fdecision over whether to move a school 
OL,8,Fin Reigate has already been made.      
OL,10,FFor several years, there has been a    
OL,11,FSurrey County Council (SCC) plan to    
OL,12,Frelocate Reigate Priory Junior School  
OL,13,Ffrom its current premises in Priory    
OL,14,FPark to a new site at Woodhatch Place  
OL,15,Fon Cockshot Hill, and, in January, it  
OL,16,Fwas approved by the cabinet.           
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
