OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 327 Mon 23 NovC07:26/53
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a row over moving a Surrey    
OL,4,Aschool is not ending                   
OL,6,FThen in October, the executive at East 
OL,7,FSurrey Council (ESC), which will be    
OL,8,Fresponsible for many local schools from
OL,9,FApril next year, granted legal consent 
OL,10,Fso that a #31m construction contract   
OL,11,Ffor the new school could be awarded.   
OL,13,FBut a campaign by parents who are      
OL,14,Fopposed to the move going ahead shows  
OL,15,Fno signs of stopping and questions     
OL,16,Fabout the project continue to be asked 
OL,17,Fby councillors.                        
